OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Anonymous
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod explores how the
OL,6,     Glabel 'Anonymous' can be used to
OL,7,     Gbring together disparate creators
OL,8,     Gand give their works a shared
OL,9,     Gidentity. With Lisa Colton and
OL,10,     GFay Hield.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GFlautist Lisa Friend, pianist
OL,13,     GMark Kinkaid and cellist Martin
OL,14,     GRadford perform live. Pianist
OL,15,     GLucy Parham and actress Joanna
OL,16,     GDavid discuss the music of Clara
OL,17,     GSchumann.
OL,18,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,19,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,20,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,21,     Gfavourites, including music by
OL,22,     GGrieg, Liszt and Szymanowska.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
